---
import AppShell from '../../components/AppShell.astro';
import { appVersion, contentVersion } from '../../lib/version';
import { site } from '../../site.config';

const { maker } = site;
---

<AppShell
  title={`About & Guide | ${site.name}`}
  description="Who built Stuti Songs, how to contact Excel Tech Solutions, and how to use the hymnal."
>
  <article class="prose guide">
    <h1 class="page-title">About & Guide</h1>
    <p class="muted">
      Free hymnal · works offline · no ads, no sign-in
    </p>

    <h2 id="built">Who built this</h2>
    <p>
      {site.name} was built by <strong>{maker.name}</strong> — a digital agency for churches, businesses, and
      teams that need clear, reliable software.
    </p>

    <a class="maker-preview" href={maker.url} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
      <span class="maker-preview__chrome" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="maker-preview__dot"></span>
        <span class="maker-preview__dot"></span>
        <span class="maker-preview__dot"></span>
        <span class="maker-preview__url">{maker.host}</span>
      </span>
      <span class="maker-preview__body">
        <span class="maker-preview__name">{maker.name}</span>
        <span class="maker-preview__blurb">{maker.blurb}</span>
        <span class="maker-preview__cta">Visit website →</span>
      </span>
    </a>

    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <p>Reach {maker.name} using the details below:</p>
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <a class="contact-card" href={`mailto:${maker.email}`}>
        <span class="contact-card__label">Email</span>
        <span class="contact-card__value">{maker.email}</span>
      </a>
      <div class="contact-card">
        <span class="contact-card__label">Phone</span>
        <div class="contact-pills">
          {
            maker.phones.map((tel, i) => (
              <a class="contact-pill" href={`tel:${tel}`}>
                {maker.phoneLabels[i]}
              </a>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a class="map-preview" href={maker.mapsUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
      <span class="map-preview__bar" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="map-preview__pin"></span>
        <span>Google Maps · Lucknow</span>
      </span>
      <span class="map-preview__body">
        <span class="map-preview__name">{maker.name}</span>
        <span class="map-preview__addr">{maker.address}</span>
        <span class="map-preview__cta">Open in Google Maps →</span>
      </span>
    </a>

    <h2 id="guide">Guide</h2>
    <nav class="toc" aria-label="Topics">
      <a href="#find">Find a song</a>
      <a href="#number">Hymn number</a>
      <a href="#read">Reading</a>
      <a href="#set">Plan a set</a>
      <a href="#share">Share</a>
      <a href="#present">Present</a>
      <a href="#offline">Offline</a>
      <a href="#report">Report</a>
      <a href="#settings">Settings</a>
    </nav>

    <h3 id="find">Find a song</h3>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">1</span><span>Tap <strong>Search</strong> in the bottom bar, then <strong>हिन्दी</strong> or <strong>English</strong>.</span></div>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">2</span><span>Tap the first letter of the song.</span></div>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">3</span><span>Tap the song. Use <strong>Book</strong> and <strong>Topic</strong> to narrow.</span></div>
    <img class="guide-shot" src="/guide/find.png" alt="Search by language and letter" loading="lazy" width="390" height="520" />

    <h3 id="number">Find by hymn number</h3>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">1</span><span><strong>Home</strong> → <strong>Hymnbooks</strong> → tap your book.</span></div>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">2</span><span>Songs are in number order. Tap <strong>50, 100…</strong> in the jump bar.</span></div>
    <img class="guide-shot" src="/guide/number.png" alt="Book page in hymn-number order" loading="lazy" width="390" height="520" />

    <h3 id="read">Reading</h3>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">1</span><span>Use <strong>A↓ / A↑</strong> in the toolbar to adjust text size.</span></div>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">2</span><span>Tap the <strong>Sun</strong> icon to keep the screen on, or <strong>Videos</strong> to watch a tune/lyric video.</span></div>
    <img class="guide-shot" src="/guide/read.png" alt="Song page toolbar and lyrics" loading="lazy" width="390" height="520" />

    <h3 id="set">Plan a set</h3>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">1</span><span><strong>Sets</strong> → <strong>New set</strong> → pick a service → <strong>Create</strong>.</span></div>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">2</span><span>Choose the section, type hymn numbers like <strong>12, 46</strong>, and press Enter.</span></div>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">3</span><span>Tap a song row to set verses (and key, if enabled in Settings).</span></div>
    <img class="guide-shot" src="/guide/plan.png" alt="Set editor" loading="lazy" width="390" height="520" />

    <h3 id="share">Share a set</h3>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">1</span><span>In the set, tap <strong>Share</strong> for WhatsApp, Copy link, QR, Calendar, Order of service, or PowerPoint.</span></div>

    <h3 id="present">Show on a projector</h3>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">1</span><span>Tap <strong>Present</strong>. Keys: <strong>→</strong> next, <strong>←</strong> back, <strong>B</strong> black screen, <strong>Esc</strong> exit.</span></div>

    <h3 id="offline">Use without internet</h3>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">1</span><span><strong>Offline</strong> tab → tap download next to a book → wait for the check mark.</span></div>

    <h3 id="report">Report a mistake</h3>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">1</span><span>Scroll to the bottom of any song and tap <strong>Report a mistake</strong> (or long-press any line) → write the correct words → <strong>Send</strong>.</span></div>

    <h3 id="settings">Settings</h3>
    <p>
      Tap the gear: Theme (System / Light / Dark), text size, church book, church name. Theme is remembered on
      every page without refreshing.
    </p>

    <h3>FAQ</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>No internet?</strong> Download books on Offline first.</li>
      <li><strong>Wrong words?</strong> Bottom of song → Report a mistake.</li>
      <li><strong>Is it free?</strong> Yes. No ads, no tracking.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="muted">
      Version {appVersion} · data {contentVersion} · <a href="/about/">Privacy &amp; rights</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</AppShell>

<style>
  .guide-toc {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .guide h2,
  .guide h3 {
    scroll-margin-top: 72px;
  }
  .maker-preview {
    display: block;
    margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    background: var(--page);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px color-mix(in oklab, var(--ink) 8%, transparent);
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }
  .maker-preview:hover,
  .maker-preview:focus-visible {
    border-color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--gold-ink) 45%, var(--line));
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .maker-preview__chrome {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: var(--leather);
    color: var(--gold-soft);
  }
  .maker-preview__dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--gold) 55%, transparent);
  }
  .maker-preview__url {
    margin-left: 8px;
    font: 600 12px/1 var(--font-ui);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    opacity: 0.9;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .maker-preview__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 14px 16px 16px;
  }
  .maker-preview__name {
    font: 700 1.15rem/1.3 var(--font-display);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .maker-preview__blurb {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .maker-preview__cta {
    margin-top: 4px;
    font: 600 0.9rem/1.2 var(--font-ui);
    color: var(--gold-ink);
  }
  .maker-contact {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1.5rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .maker-contact li {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2px;
  }
  .maker-contact strong {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
